# Line endings.
#
# Biome formats to LF and CI runs on Linux, so CI has always been green. On a
# Windows checkout `core.autocrlf` hands the working tree CRLF, biome reports
# every such file as a formatting error, and `pnpm lint` fails locally on a
# tree that is perfectly clean in CI — a gate that cries wolf is a gate people
# stop running. Normalising here makes the two agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
